  "taal_vir_mens": [
    "[taal, protected word] 'Ander kieme is al met 'n kleurstof gekleur': In a past-tense narrative the present perfect passive 'is al ... gekleur' reads as if it is still happening now; 'was al ... gekleur' (and then 'sodat hulle beter kon uitstaan') would give the correct time relation. Not changed because the wording is protected.",
    "[taal, protected word] 'een van die grootste oorsake van dood': 'oorsake van dood' follows the English 'causes of death'; idiomatic Afrikaans is 'doodsoorsake' ('een van die grootste doodsoorsake'), which keeps the checked quantifier 'een van die'. Not changed because the wording is protected."
